sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Handler
    participant SS as SubscriptionService
    participant CS as CatalogService
    participant W as monitoring.Worker
    participant GH as GitHub API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant FW as fanout.Worker
    participant OR as outbox.Relay
    participant N as NATS JetStream
    participant CN as Consumer
    participant M as Mailer
    participant DLQ as NATS DLQ Stream

    Note over C,M: Subscribe
    C->>H: POST /api/subscribe
    H->>SS: Subscribe(email, repo)
    SS->>GH: CheckRepo(owner/name)
    GH-->>SS: 200 / 404 / 429
    SS->>CS: Ensure(owner/name)
    CS->>DB: UPSERT repository
    CS-->>SS: repoID
    Note over SS,DB: single Postgres transaction
    SS->>DB: INSERT subscription (pending)
    SS->>DB: INSERT outbox (notifications.confirmation)
    H-->>C: 200 OK

    Note over OR,N: async — outbox.Relay polls every 1 s
    OR->>DB: SELECT outbox WHERE published_at IS NULL FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    DB-->>OR: pending row
    OR->>N: js.Publish notifications.confirmation (WithMsgID)
    N-->>OR: PubAck
    OR->>DB: UPDATE outbox SET published_at = now()
    N-->>CN: deliver
    CN->>M: SendConfirmation(email, repo, token)
    alt success
        CN->>N: Ack
    else transient failure, retries remaining
        CN->>N: Nak (redeliver, up to MaxDeliver 5)
    else retries exhausted OR bad JSON
        CN->>DLQ: js.Publish dlq.notifications (DeadLetter envelope)
        CN->>N: Ack
    end

    Note over C,M: Confirm
    C->>H: GET /api/confirm/{token}
    H->>SS: Confirm(token)
    SS->>DB: UPDATE subscription SET confirmed_at = now()
    H-->>C: 200 OK

    Note over W,M: Release scan — every 25 s
    W->>CS: ListTracked
    CS->>DB: SELECT repositories
    DB-->>W: []Repository
    loop each repository (concurrent, max 10)
        W->>GH: GetLatestTag(owner/name)
        GH-->>W: tag / not found
        alt new tag
            Note over W,DB: single Postgres transaction
            W->>DB: UPDATE repositories SET last_seen_tag
            W->>DB: INSERT detected_releases (fanout.Enqueue in tx callback)
        end
    end

    Note over DB,FW: async — fanout.Worker polls every 1 s
    FW->>DB: SELECT detected_releases WHERE processed_at IS NULL FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    DB-->>FW: pending release
    FW->>SS: ListConfirmedByRepositoryID(repoID)
    SS->>DB: SELECT confirmed subscriptions
    DB-->>FW: []Recipient
    Note over DB,FW: single Postgres transaction
    loop each recipient
        FW->>DB: INSERT outbox (notifications.release)
    end
    FW->>DB: UPDATE detected_releases SET processed_at = now()

    Note over OR,N: async — outbox.Relay picks up release rows
    OR->>DB: SELECT outbox WHERE published_at IS NULL FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    DB-->>OR: pending row (per recipient)
    OR->>N: js.Publish notifications.release (WithMsgID)
    N-->>OR: PubAck
    OR->>DB: UPDATE outbox SET published_at = now()
    N-->>CN: deliver
    CN->>M: SendRelease(email, token, tag, name, url)
    alt success
        CN->>N: Ack
    else transient failure, retries remaining
        CN->>N: Nak (redeliver, up to MaxDeliver 5)
    else retries exhausted OR bad JSON
        CN->>DLQ: js.Publish dlq.notifications (DeadLetter envelope)
        CN->>N: Ack
    end
